OL,3,GNEWSAGlampsite owner appeals #135k bill
OL,4,Aafter blocking neighbours from using   
OL,5,Atheir driveway                         
OL,7,FA glampsite owner is challenging a     
OL,8,Fcourt order to pay #135,000 in legal   
OL,9,Fcosts after she tried to block her     
OL,10,Fneighbours from parking their car in   
OL,11,Ftheir own garden.                      
OL,13,FCarol Esteban told her neighbours Neil 
OL,14,Fand Nadine Gould that their right to   
OL,15,Fuse their shared driveway ended        
OL,16,Fopposite their front door, which would 
OL,17,Fblock them from their parking space.   
OL,19,FBoth sides accused the other of        
OL,20,Ftrespassing, while Esteban was accused 
OL,21,Fof using "boulders" to block the       
OL,22,Fcouple's access to the shared track.   
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
